- Client API wrapper.
- JSON parsing.
- Zod validation.
- Error handling.
- Request payload.
- File parsing.
- Text extraction.
- Save operation.

Find out why the frontend considers an HTTP 200 response unreadable.

Potential causes may include mismatched response contracts, an empty response body, unexpected HTML, incorrectly wrapped JSON, malformed model output or invalid client-side parsing.

