- Optional camera.
- Discreet confidence coaching.

The candidate's question and answer experience should receive most of the visual attention.

Remove unnecessary panels.

Use polished, calm animations.

**Acceptance requirement:** A candidate must be able to start a text interview and complete an evaluation even when Live API or microphone access is unavailable. Where microphone and TTS are supported, a genuine voice conversation must work.

